{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0174_1000_p", "source_sha256": "bb4649db4b1e5cb7d689de3cb39ccbf9a6b2f3e8545b313a70677b8bea94e8f0", "ja": "瑞希、お疲れ様。衣装のフィッティング中みたいだな。\nサイズとか、大丈夫そうか？", "zh": "瑞希，辛苦了。好像正在试穿演出服呢。\n尺寸什么的，没问题吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0174_1001_044miz", "source_sha256": "62c02f75d631030e9e6869de3b0d467197e3be8ce61ed62074f0d72d785d8675", "ja": "あ、{$P$}……。\nお疲れさまです。はい、大丈夫です。……ドキドキ。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}……\n辛苦了。嗯，没问题。……心里怦怦跳。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0174_1002_p", "source_sha256": "b7b9b5d0ecc92effef092a41f450fdb06a9ffd0ea3bddef3e15c5e1b759f5bca", "ja": "着心地はどうだ？\nあと、動きやすさとか、デザインとか。", "zh": "穿起来感觉怎么样？\n还有活动起来是否方便、设计之类的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0174_1003_044miz", "source_sha256": "b52b0c919f5325563a81e92bd82569052e3504b4c0ce67cd3022a4853d9aadbc", "ja": "はい、とても快適に動けます。\nデザインも、とてもかわいいです。……ドキドキ。", "zh": "是的，穿起来活动非常舒适。\n设计也非常可爱。……心跳得好快。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0174_1004_p", "source_sha256": "9e0e1adb2cf1ca3f895bc2c106eb8362c942d5f476c80fe4978e9f7869a28d1c", "ja": "そうか、ならよかった。……ところで瑞希、\nさっきから、何をドキドキしてるんだ？", "zh": "这样啊，那就好。……话说回来，瑞希，\n你从刚才开始就一直在因为什么而心跳加速？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0174_1005_044miz", "source_sha256": "f023c90297f247a56366bb6bbc0e4e86c8a87fef5fdce2c7722464f997bd4838", "ja": "はっ。……やはり、{$P$}には\n伝わっていましたか。さすがです。", "zh": "啊……果然还是被{$P$}察觉到了吗。真不愧是您。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0174_1006_p", "source_sha256": "79406c263faf71411bc6514e1a6274b7eab20861ac5f88d49bcb5eee28dae500", "ja": "いや、それほどでもないけど……。", "zh": "不，也没那么夸张啦……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0174_1007_044miz", "source_sha256": "9d9a928e6371880a237c5dca42b0a8b64b6fc66bbefd4f580d71794a54dbf359", "ja": "ひと目見ただけで、私はこの衣装をとても気に入りまし\nた。鏡から目が離せなくなるほどです。……じーっ。", "zh": "我只看了一眼，就非常喜欢上了这套服装\n。喜欢到视线都无法从镜子上移开。……盯——。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0174_1008_044miz", "source_sha256": "3e4a16fd4328c202f54fd8c10c09b4c35873da4e5c171790c6f01c3c16b0a786", "ja": "おっと。ですから、この衣装を用意してくれた人には、\n私の気持ちが見透かされていた、ということなります。", "zh": "哎呀。所以说，准备这套服装的人，已经看穿了我的心思。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0174_1009_044miz", "source_sha256": "45aff4e9e06876cf880514d7e0a6131f0fd7b142094f5fe428055615b9fc044e", "ja": "つまり{$P$}は、私の気持ちを\nすべてお見通し、ということに。……ドキドキ。", "zh": "也就是说，{$P$}把我的心思全都看穿了。……扑通扑通。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0174_1010_p", "source_sha256": "83f81e7e55f782b90e52230d1dde4897a6ff552aeea42b9428a8e02908ae807c", "ja": "な、なるほど……。すべては大げさだと思うけど、\nまあ、瑞希の好みぐらいなら、少しはわかるかな？", "zh": "原、原来如此……。不过要说全都看穿了，未免有点夸张，\n至少瑞希的喜好，我还是能了解一些的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0174_1011_044miz", "source_sha256": "68d2e26be65350d75c6c5a05bf576d4de45b2109d23b173adff1a67057ae1bd2", "ja": "少しですか……。\nでは昨日の夜、私が何を食べたかはわかりますか。", "zh": "只是稍微吗……\n那么您知道我昨天晚上吃了什么吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0174_1012_p", "source_sha256": "a2abcfe99a4c7981036e4ad1fe7c9c7c704720872a6a3d6d593d06d0df127213", "ja": "いや、それはわからないが。", "zh": "不，这个我怎么可能知道啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0174_1013_044miz", "source_sha256": "4ef9cbde412ff67146b5f69a12b5aebd120a6ed370c9667c09c3e3630430dd08", "ja": "ヒントは、ロシア料理です。\n数字で言うと、ロクの次で、ハチの前の……。", "zh": "提示是俄罗斯料理。\n用数字来说，就是六的后面、八的前面……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0174_1014_044miz", "source_sha256": "459fcda31cb5c7e431b0bad190bea6070e36334b454422dac74f62c2c95961ea", "ja": "ボル。", "zh": "博尔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0174_1016", "source_sha256": "e85a1f268495227eaa621df7829845db6f7ec590cd26b440e0ec1a0118782d9b", "ja": "ボルシチ！", "zh": "罗宋汤！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0174_2000_p", "source_sha256": "0e278fe956c8ffc18da94c7cf7afbbdbadb3f23cab52658b86402a635f213e06", "ja": "わかった、ボルシチだな！", "zh": "知道了，是罗宋汤对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0174_2001_044miz", "source_sha256": "5d7955b8717c10bd8869d1d20e443b646bdcf33b4b1d5e220a955dccee9e4d6f", "ja": "はい、正解です。……さすが、お見通し。", "zh": "是的，答对了。……不愧是你，什么都瞒不过你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0174_2002_044miz", "source_sha256": "ae8c9c392299f34287103dab8a7435342d1139d9e5d703581aa4297f261c5584", "ja": "それでは、最終問題です。\n最後なので、ポイント2倍。", "zh": "那么，接下来是最后一道题。\n既然是最后一题，得分就是2倍。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0174_2003_044miz", "source_sha256": "52867284f29dfa71de54c5271d2813d75ae9afc19dc226524e7da6988bd78a07", "ja": "私、真壁瑞希は、こんなに素敵な衣装をもらって、\n今、どんな気持ちでしょうか？", "zh": "我，真壁瑞希，收到了这么漂亮的服装，\n现在是什么心情呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0174_2004_044miz", "source_sha256": "41c5ca0d5a74b4c09e71563a94d1abd8b7c5df515de298586005b2c95459527e", "ja": "これはノーヒントでお答えください。……ニヤニヤ。", "zh": "请不要提示任何线索，直接回答。……嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0174_2005_p", "source_sha256": "417a935ef59711af84d49bc9a9bc7d96a4ef7ac6571f7130365529f8e87582e1", "ja": "いつの間にクイズに……。\nでも、それなら簡単だ。たぶん……。", "zh": "怎么不知不觉变成猜谜了……\n不过，这样的话就很简单了。大概吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0174_2006", "source_sha256": "e8d7821591edc9f9048d6ecfc9632b5c980c9b6af18c53d6ddd226fa16476552", "ja": "同じ気持ち", "zh": "相同的心情", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0174_3000_p", "source_sha256": "5b26a7351191168d0b6c01b8cacf2f74d25a27aa9b961b8bf16274caaf232d47", "ja": "アイドルに新しい衣装を気に入ってもらえた\nプロデューサーと、同じ気持ち……かな。", "zh": "和让偶像喜欢上新服装的制作人，是同样的心情……吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0174_3001_044miz", "source_sha256": "7f0f6da53d562c37e2094ed53b2612106e3772c39ae239a6b53b9d07243a9bf0", "ja": "……。\nそう、ですか。私と、同じ……。", "zh": "……。\n这样，啊。和我，一样……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0174_3002_044miz", "source_sha256": "86562d809a7904d99dd7aaffe044078fd90ee8cc3cd7d74040ac25b451889968", "ja": "{$P$}。\n私はつい先ほどまで、浮かれていましたが……。", "zh": "{$P$}。\n我直到刚才还一直沉浸在喜悦之中……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0174_3003_044miz", "source_sha256": "1523b687870bf809c02e62d3170793c133a08751a0cd9642d01cefbad712cc03", "ja": "今、ますます、幸せな気持ちになってしまいました。\nドキドキが……、とまりません……。", "zh": "现在，反而变得更加幸福了。\n心跳……停不下来……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
